## 5.3 插值查找与斐波那契查找
### 插值查找
```java
// 插值查找 - 适合均匀分布的有序数据
public int interpolationSearch(int[] arr, int target) {
    int left = 0, right = arr.length - 1;
    while (left <= right && target >= arr[left] && target <= arr[right]) {
        // 插值公式
        int pos = left + (target - arr[left]) * (right - left) / (arr[right] - arr[left]);
        if (arr[pos] == target) return pos;
        if (arr[pos] < target) left = pos + 1;
        else right = pos - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}
```
### 斐波那契查找
```java
public class FibonacciSearch {
    private int[] fib;

    public FibonacciSearch() {
        fib = new int[20];
        fib[0] = 0; fib[1] = 1;
        for (int i = 2; i < fib.length; i++) {
            fib[i] = fib[i - 1] + fib[i - 2];
        }
    }

    public int search(int[] arr, int target) {
        int n = arr.length;
        int k = 0;
        while (fib[k] < n) k++;  // 找到合适的斐波那契数

        // 扩展数组
        int[] extended = new int[fib[k]];
        System.arraycopy(arr, 0, extended, 0, n);

        int left = 0, right = fib[k] - 1;
        while (left <= right) {
            int mid = left + fib[k - 1] - 1;
            if (extended[mid] < target) {
                left = mid + 1;
                k -= 2;
            } else if (extended[mid] > target) {
                right = mid - 1;
                k -= 1;
            } else {
                return Math.min(mid, n - 1);
            }
        }
        return -1;
    }
}
```
## 5.4 哈希查找
```java
// 基于哈希表的查找 - O(1)平均
public class HashSearch {
    private static final int SIZE = 1000;
    private LinkedList<Entry>[] table;

    public HashSearch() {
        table = new LinkedList[SIZE];
    }

    public void put(int key, int value) {
        int idx = hash(key);
        if (table[idx] == null) table[idx] = new LinkedList<>();
        for (Entry e : table[idx]) {
            if (e.key == key) { e.value = value; return; }
        }
        table[idx].add(new Entry(key, value));
    }

    public Integer get(int key) {
        int idx = hash(key);
        if (table[idx] != null) {
            for (Entry e : table[idx]) {
                if (e.key == key) return e.value;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

    private int hash(int key) {
        return (key & 0x7FFFFFFF) % SIZE;
    }

    static class Entry { int key, value; Entry(int k, int v) { key = k; value = v; } }
}
```
## 5.5 JDK查找源码解析
```java
// Arrays.binarySearch 实现
public class Arrays {
    public static int binarySearch(int[] a, int key) {
        return binarySearch0(a, 0, a.length, key);
    }

    private static int binarySearch0(int[] a, int fromIndex, int toIndex, int key) {
        int low = fromIndex;
        int high = toIndex - 1;
        while (low <= high) {
            int mid = (low + high) >>> 1;  // 无符号右移防溢出
            int midVal = a[mid];
            if (midVal < key) low = mid + 1;
            else if (midVal > key) high = mid - 1;
            else return mid;
        }
        return -(low + 1);  // 返回插入点负值
    }

    // 插入点计算
    public static int binarySearchInsertionPoint(int[] a, int key) {
        int low = 0, high = a.length - 1;
        while (low <= high) {
            int mid = (low + high) >>> 1;
            if (key <= a[mid]) high = mid - 1;
            else low = mid + 1;
        }
        return low;
    }
}
```
## 5.6 查找算法选择策略
```java
public class SearchSelector {
    // 无序数据 → 线性查找
    public int linear(int[] arr, int target) { /* O(n) */ return -1; }

    // 有序数据 → 二分查找
    public int binary(int[] arr, int target) { /* O(log n) */ return -1; }

    // 均匀分布 → 插值查找
    public int interpolation(int[] arr, int target) { /* O(log log n) */ return -1; }

    // 大数据 + 频繁查找 → 哈希查找
    public int hash(int[] arr, int target) { /* O(1) */ return -1; }

    // 旋转数组 → 改进二分
    public int rotated(int[] arr, int target) { /* O(log n) */ return -1; }
}
```
## 5.7 本章小结
- 有序数据优先选择二分查找，O(log n)效率高
- 掌握各类变体：左边界、右边界、旋转数组
- 注意溢出问题，使用 (left + right) >>> 1 而非 (left + right) / 2
- 哈希查找O(1)但需要额外空间
- 根据数据特征选择合适的查找算法